| Estimate hierarchy (M20) | `projects/:id/estimate/*`, `estimate-packages/:id/*`, `estimate-documents/:id/lines`, `…/lines/import-csv`, `…/estimate/finance-contract` | Dual mode FLAT_BOQ / ESTIMATE_HIERARCHY; pack → LCR/OCR/SC/SSR/COST_SUMMARY; CSV line import; approve → BoqLine + event `lines[]` → Finance SOV seed; hub **Estimate** tab; SKU `construction_estimate_hierarchy`; ADR construction-estimate-hierarchy D4b |
