| Progress acts | `projects/:id/acts`, `progress-acts/:id/lines`, `…/approve`, `…/finance-payapp` | Ops SOV lines; Finance journal `construction:{actId}`; soft PayApp ref |
| Depth (Wave 3) | `parties`, `rfis`, `submittals`, `inspections`, `change-requests`, `cde/documents`, daily/punch deepen | hub Depth tab; status transitions + stub contract events; money ref-only |
| BIM lite (CN-BIM-01) | punch + RFI `ifcElementId` / `externalViewerUrl` | SKU `construction_bim_lite` / TIER_3 gate via billing-snapshot; Ops + `/field-ops` + Depth; http(s) viewer URL validation; chips only when gated on; no CDE authoring |
