**Tenancy (CP-TENANT-01):** SHARED default — `organizationId` on tenant/ops models + kit Prisma extension + `requireSatelliteModule("industry_construction")` (AC-CON-TENANT 🟡 until field two-org UAT).

| Access matrix (CN-RBAC-01) | Nest `/api/admin/roles`, `/api/admin/roles/:code`, `/api/admin/roles/:code/permissions`, `/api/internal/v1/workforce/roles`, `/api/admin/users`, `/api/auth/me`, `/api/auth/session/refresh-permissions`, `/api/auth/logout`; page `/admin/access` | `Role` (`isSystem`, `cloneFromCode`, `permissionCatalogVersion`), `SatelliteAuditLog`; catalog `src/lib/auth/permissions.ts`; page map `page-route-permissions.ts`; API map `api-route-permissions.ts` |
| Integration channels | `/admin/links`, `GET/PATCH /api/admin/links` (Nest) | CP-CHANNELS-01 SatAdmin peer channels + money mode |

**RBAC Variant A (CN-RBAC-01):** `getSatelliteSession()` also builds `permissions` from the role row and checks the stamped API path against `api-route-permissions.ts` (unlisted → 403). Pages: middleware `authorizePage` + `page-route-permissions.ts`. A new staff route or page needs a catalog row in the same change. Progress act approve is `api:acts.approve`; the APPROVED reopen refusal stays a domain rule. ADR construction-domain-permissions-and-rbac.

## Platform billing status

`GET /api/platform/billing-status` — Nest kit edge (`kit-routes.ts` → `@era/satellite-kit/billing/status-route`; banner in `EraAppRouteShell`). Staff calls the orchestrator denies (SOFT_BLOCK export, HARD_BLOCK write) get 402 from kit `readSatelliteStaffSession`; `handleRouteError` returns `{ error, code, billingStatus }`. ADR `docs/adr/billing-enforcement-satellites.md`.
